Package: zonaro-nautilus-common
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0
Description: shared infrastructure for the zonaro Nautilus extensions
 Provides the system payload directory (/usr/share/zonaro-nautilus-extensions),
 the per-user linker (/usr/bin/zonaro-nautilus-link) and an XDG autostart
 entry that links every installed extension into
 ~/.local/share/nautilus-python/extensions at session start.
 .
 Extensions disabled through the Extensions Manager (moved to the disabled/
 subfolder) are left untouched, so a user's choice survives across logins.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-archive-browser
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common, p7zip-full, unrar | unrar-free, python3-libarchive-c
Description: browse, extract and create archives from Nautilus
 Full archive manager for Nautilus supporting ZIP, 7z, RAR, TAR, GZ, BZ2, XZ,
 CAB and ISO, including multi-volume archives, password prompts, a collapsible
 tree view and archive creation from the selection.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-clone-repository
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common, git, gh
Description: clone git repositories from the Nautilus context menu
 Clone any git repository into the current folder with URL paste and gh
 autocompletion. Inside a repository a Git submenu offers Pull, Push, Fetch,
 Status, History, Commit, Branch and Stash actions.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-column-browser
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common
Description: Miller-columns folder browser for Nautilus
 A fast, read-focused, chained column browser (macOS Finder style), launched
 with F9 or from the context menu, with drag-to-resize columns and asynchronous
 per-column loading through GIO.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-compress-pdf
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common, ghostscript, python3-pypdf, python3-pil, poppler-utils
Description: compress PDF files from Nautilus
 Batch PDF compression through Ghostscript with four quality presets, live
 before/after size comparison and optional OCR preprocessing.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-cut-dim
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common
Description: visually dim items cut with Ctrl+X in Nautilus
 Dims files that were cut to the clipboard so you never forget what is waiting
 to be pasted.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-deb-installer
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common, policykit-1 | polkitd
Description: install .deb packages graphically from Nautilus
 Right-click a .deb file to inspect its metadata, check for missing
 dependencies and install it with real-time output, authenticating through
 pkexec.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-dev-tools-minify
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common
Description: minify JS/CSS files from the Nautilus context menu
 Regex-based, dependency-free minifier that writes a side-by-side name.min.ext
 file and reports the size savings, skipping already-minified files.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-dual-panel
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common, rsync
Description: dual-pane file manager inside Nautilus
 A complete double-pane file manager launched with F3 or from the context
 menu, with list/grid views, drag and drop, an rsync progress bar, cross-panel
 copy/move and cross-extension awareness.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-duration-column
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common, ffmpeg
Description: duration column for audio/video files in Nautilus
 Adds a sortable HH:MM:SS Duration column for audio and video files, using
 ffprobe.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-extensions-manager
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common
Description: enable or disable zonaro Nautilus extensions
 A central hub listing every installed extension (active and disabled) with
 one-click enable/disable toggles and a Restart Nautilus button. Disabled
 extensions stay disabled across logins thanks to the common linker.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-extract-here
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common, p7zip-full, unrar | unrar-free
Description: fast archive extraction in place from Nautilus
 Right-click an archive to extract it here, with multi-volume 7z and RAR
 support, password prompts and a live progress dialog.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-file-tools
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common, python3-pil
Description: assorted file utilities for the Nautilus context menu
 Friendly URL rename, copy path, enum bulk rename, clean empty folders,
 YYYY/MM/DD timestamp folders, symlink creation, Base64 Data URL copy and
 clipboard copy of text or image content.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-folder-color-revival
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common, python3-pil
Description: folder color and emblem tagging for Nautilus
 Revives folder colourisation on modern Nautilus, with custom colours, emblem
 tagging and automatic import of Dolphin (KDE) folder colours. Ships its
 name_to_color helper and colour database.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-hidden-dim-all
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common
Conflicts: zonaro-nautilus-hidden-dim-icon
Replaces: zonaro-nautilus-hidden-dim-icon
Description: dim icon and label of hidden files in Nautilus
 Event-driven dimming of both the icon and the label of dot-prefixed hidden
 files when "Show hidden files" is enabled.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-hidden-dim-icon
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common
Conflicts: zonaro-nautilus-hidden-dim-all
Replaces: zonaro-nautilus-hidden-dim-all
Description: dim the icon of hidden files in Nautilus
 Event-driven dimming of only the icon of dot-prefixed hidden files when
 "Show hidden files" is enabled.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-image-tools
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common, python3-pil, python3-cairo, ffmpeg, zonaro-nautilus-media-converter
Description: image editing tools for the Nautilus context menu
 Grayscale, invert, crop, circle, resize, combine, watermark, colourise and
 web-optimise actions built on Pillow, plus an annotate editor and nested
 convert-image and remove-AI-watermarks submenus.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-media-converter
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common, ffmpeg, ffmpegthumbnailer, python3-pil
Description: shared media conversion library for Nautilus (no standalone menu)
 Shared media_core Python library plus the shared media_dialogs GTK UI used
 by the video-tools, audio-tools and image-tools extensions. This package
 registers no context menu of its own (legacy shim only).
 .
 Conversion entries live in "Video Tools", "Audio Tools" and "Image Tools".

Package: zonaro-nautilus-video-tools
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common, ffmpeg, zonaro-nautilus-media-converter
Description: convert videos and extract audio from Nautilus
 "Video Tools" submenu: quick video conversion (MP4, MKV, WebM, MOV, AVI),
 audio extraction (MP3, M4A, Opus, FLAC, WAV), the full extraction dialog
 and an advanced conversion dialog, all batch-capable with progress.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-audio-tools
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common, ffmpeg, python3-mutagen, zonaro-nautilus-media-converter
Description: convert audio files and edit tags from Nautilus
 "Audio Tools" submenu: quick audio conversion (MP3, M4A, Opus, OGG, FLAC,
 WAV), an advanced conversion dialog and a full tag editor (title, artist,
 album, genre, track, cover art) for MP3, M4A, OGG, Opus and FLAC.

