Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common
Description: open text files with any installed editor from Nautilus
 Adds an alphabetical "Open with" submenu listing every installed text editor,
 filtered by file extension to avoid clutter.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-paste-into-file
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common
Description: paste clipboard contents into a new file from Nautilus
 Saves clipboard text (.txt), images (.png/.jpg) or copied files (.zip,
 structure preserved) with a preview dialog and a timestamped default name.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-preview-panel
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common, ffmpeg, ffmpegthumbnailer, poppler-utils, python3-pil
Description: preview panel for selected files in Nautilus
 A dynamic side preview showing images, video thumbnails, first PDF pages and
 text content, toggled from the context menu or with F4.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-progress-mirror
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common
Description: mirror long copy/move progress in a small window
 Shows a small window over Nautilus during long copy or move operations,
 mirroring the native progress bar and cancel button while staying silent for
 short operations.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-search-content
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common, ripgrep | grep
Description: search and replace text content from Nautilus
 Reliable recursive text search with extension filters and live search-and-
 replace preview (grep, or ripgrep when available), skipping binary files and
 heavy folders. Launchable with F8.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-video-to-audio
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common, ffmpeg, ffmpegthumbnailer, python3-pil, zonaro-nautilus-media-converter, zonaro-nautilus-video-tools
Description: legacy audio-extraction dialog reused by Video Tools (no menu)
 Legacy shim kept for compatibility: provides the full extraction window
 reused by "Video Tools" > "Extract audio" > "Full extraction…".
 Registers no context menu of its own.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-watermark-pdf
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-nautilus-4.0, zonaro-nautilus-common, ghostscript, python3-pypdf, python3-pil, poppler-utils
Description: watermark PDF files from Nautilus
 Text or image watermarks with configurable font, size, colour, opacity,
 position, rotation and per-page or whole-document application, with optional
 output flattening.

Package: zonaro-nautilus-all
Architecture: all
 Depends: ${misc:Depends}, zonaro-nautilus-common, zonaro-nautilus-archive-browser, zonaro-nautilus-audio-tools, zonaro-nautilus-clone-repository, zonaro-nautilus-column-browser, zonaro-nautilus-compress-pdf, zonaro-nautilus-cut-dim, zonaro-nautilus-deb-installer, zonaro-nautilus-dev-tools-minify, zonaro-nautilus-dual-panel, zonaro-nautilus-duration-column, zonaro-nautilus-extensions-manager, zonaro-nautilus-extract-here, zonaro-nautilus-file-tools, zonaro-nautilus-folder-color-revival, zonaro-nautilus-hidden-dim-all, zonaro-nautilus-image-tools, zonaro-nautilus-media-converter, zonaro-nautilus-merge-pdf, zonaro-nautilus-edit-with, zonaro-nautilus-paste-into-file, zonaro-nautilus-preview-panel, zonaro-nautilus-progress-mirror, zonaro-nautilus-search-content, zonaro-nautilus-video-to-audio, zonaro-nautilus-video-tools, zonaro-nautilus-watermark-pdf
Description: metapackage installing all zonaro Nautilus extensions
 Depends on every zonaro Nautilus extension. Note that it pulls in
 zonaro-nautilus-hidden-dim-all, which conflicts with and replaces
 zonaro-nautilus-hidden-dim-icon (install only one dimming variant).
